title: PulseBoard
abstract: >-
  Real-time metrics dashboard platform built with a microservices architecture.
  Collects, aggregates, and visualizes system metrics through three specialized
  services: a Python (FastAPI) API Gateway, a Go metrics-worker for statistical
  aggregation, and a TypeScript (Express) dashboard BFF.
